{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>נצבה</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other בית נתיבות נצבה. To teach that through this dream He established the house of Israel, sustaining them in the years of famine." "<b>ותשתחוין</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other ותגשן השפחות ותשתחוין. To teach that even though in the first dream he saw only a hint to the prostrations of his eleven brothers, nonetheless his entire father's house prostrated to him, as written: ותגשן השפחות הנה וילדיהן."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:49.672782346Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}